Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.90,H_fil,,0,0,0,,Nagbigay ang system ng BATTERY TECH. "Bukas, BILYONES na."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.90,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Gumawa ng bagay mula sa wala —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ito ang reward mula sa system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.82,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ano ang laman?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.10,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kumpletong tech ng lithium-air battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.94,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Yan ang sabi ng system note.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:06.88,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.02,S_fil,,0,0,0,,napatunayan mo nang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:08.96,S_fil,,0,0,0,,totoo ang system mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.14,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba ang ibig sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:11.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ako—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.02,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ibig sabihin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:12.96,S_fil,,0,0,0,,mapopromote ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.06,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Seryoso nga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.02,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Tuloy po, Uncle Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.10,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang pag-iral ng system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.04,S_fil,,0,0,0,,nangangahulugang hawak mo na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.66,S_fil,,0,0,0,,artefaktong magpapalit ng takdô mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.34,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ngayon, tech ang binibigay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bukas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.58,S_fil,,0,0,0,,bilyones na cash na ang maaari,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.82,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kahit superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.30,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Basta magpapakababa ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:27.38,S_fil,,0,0,0,,maging ikaw ang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:28.86,S_fil,,0,0,0,,bida ng mundong ito.
